    "uuid": "d94350be-8d65-4d77-8527-bc0757ef9294",
    "title": "Name the workflow, not its id, in the confirm status line",
    "description": "The in-flight status line on a CircleCI rerun confirm reads the raw workflow id: `confirm rerun 131ad9a2-a72b-4f40-abe4-81e080cf16f7 — generating…`. Found in the CircleCI app's canvas pass (7.2).\n\nThe line should name what the person acted on — the workflow's name — not its id.",
