  "A2U-7": {
    "id": "A2U-7",
    "uuid": "13bdf881-856c-459d-8a13-a9cf0a632860",
    "title": "Shell-action report hangs through the tunnel",
    "description": "Through the dev tunnel, a shell-action report can hang as a fetch for 100 s or fail with \"Failed to fetch\" about 110 s after the press, while every utterance through the same tunnel arrives at once. Seen three times in 6.6. The report is a streaming `message/send` the orchestrator answers in milliseconds; what the tunnel does with it is the open question.",
    "priority": {
      "value": 4,
      "name": "Low"
    },
